- **src/context/contentstackContext.tsx** (`ContentstackContext`): Attachment point for Live Preview: this is the single React context that holds all CMS content and feeds every Contentstack component via useContent(). Live Preview data from Contentstack's real-time SDK must be injected here — the context value is what all components read from, so updating it with live preview payload instantly propagates to every consumer.
